59627990_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FoXAraqGvuEQ7kNvwFuSefe&_nc_oc=AdrL4MmO7FmWAKPv7h8axcWcQzNWDtnTPOkFrBjfLKpj7387fSAwLioeW1kJ5-0tE-k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIRsOg_71RZ7_rrxsZ5MGod9YMNwfw2nTcanOfKKYikIQ&oe=6AAFE7F5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer Cover Image (2450x.png", "id": "538764138942433", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974512_538764142275766_3136473433595453492_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CFBSZN915KAQ7kNvwEdp43b&_nc_oc=AdqtotnD6w_H_MBmBc4ZjxyMhqISJBSC9Ea4h7hOee-zHTueFbzH1dtbWl6ULS3Z1Gg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI9my5j-gIORbnhs6DU8BGI3Q1Vrq7OE45ow2ujTAU3KQ&oe=6AAFCDFB"}, "display_name": "DeepSeeVR", "keywords": ["Underwater", "Exploration", "Scuba"], "long_description": "Dive into the mysterious depths of the ocean in DeepSee VR, an immersive mystery-adventure game where the world beneath the waves is full of beauty, danger, and hidden secrets. As a seasoned scuba diver, you\u2019ll explore vibrant coral reefs, old shipwrecks, and dark underwater caverns, all teeming with life and waiting to be discovered.\n\nBut something\u2019s not right. Strange anomalies are beginning to appear, disrupting the delicate balance of the ocean ecosystem. As you venture further into the deep, you\u2019ll encounter unsettling signs that suggest a darker force is at play beneath the surface. What\u2019s causing the strange changes in the marine life? Who is behind it all?\n\nWith each dive, you\u2019ll gather clues and piece together the truth about what lies beneath the calm exterior of the sea. But be warned \u2014 some secrets are best left undisturbed, and the deeper you go, the more dangerous the unknown becomes. Can you uncover its secrets before they\u2019re lost forever?", "short_description": "Explore the Depths. Uncover the Secrets. Save the Ocean."}]}, "developer_name"